{"unit_id":"Libraqg__ultra-documents#card-zh","repo":"Libraqg/ultra-documents","commit":"bfc1114226116654397a73c7767b366af0158f62","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ultra-documents 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的文档创作插件，可把 HTML 报告、提案、说明文档、幻灯片和图表放进右侧栏查看。它注册创建、修订、批注读取和文档列表工具，并提供侧栏批注与手动编辑界面。用户可逐段评论、将待处理意见交给模型生成新版本、查看历史版本，也能直接编辑最新文档并另存为新版本。文档按版本保存在当前工作区，适合需要反复审阅和修改可视化文档的 DSH 用户。安装需要兼容版本的 DSH Web 环境，无需额外 API Key 或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25","lib/tools.js:81","client/src/main.js:736"]}
{"unit_id":"Libraqg__ultra-documents#card-en","repo":"Libraqg/ultra-documents","commit":"bfc1114226116654397a73c7767b366af0158f62","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ultra-documents creates versioned HTML reports and visual documents in the DSH web sidebar. Users can comment on text or figures, send feedback for a model revision, browse versions, and edit the latest document. Files stay in the workspace; no extra API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25","lib/tools.js:81","client/src/main.js:736"]}
